      "text": "hi bloomtwt and zaiatwt, a friend of a friend reached out to us regarding the fire that broke out in parola, binondo, manila. they are asking for help because the only things they were able to save from the fire were their important documents. other than that, everything was destroyed.\n\nif you are nearby and have the means to donate clothes or other necessities, please consider reaching out to them. you may also retweet this post to help it reach more people who might be willing to help.\nthank you!\n\non the third and fourth pic po ay yung ss ng convo nung person na need ng help.\n\nyou can directly message the person through her fb account:\n\nDanica V Matados",
